Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer exclusive Copyright and Related Rights (defined below) upon the creator and subsequent owner(s) (each and all, an "owner") of an original work of authorship and/or a database (each, a "Work"). Certain owners wish to permanently relinquish those rights to a Work for the purpose of contributing to a commons of creative, cultural and scientific works ("Commons") that the public can reliably and freely build upon, reproduce, distribute, and otherwise use, whether modified or in its current form, or as part of a new work (a "Work"), freely and without Royalty or restriction, whether in commercial or non-commercial contexts.

