For the avoidance of doubt, no trademark or patent rights held by Affirmer are waived, abandoned, surrendered, licensed or otherwise affected by this document.

Affirmer offers the Work as-is and makes no representations or warranties of any kind concerning the Work, express, implied, statutory or otherwise, including without limitation warranties of title, merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, or the absence of latent or other defects, accuracy, or the present or absence of errors, whether or not discoverable, all to the greatest extent permissible under applicable law.

This document constitutes Affirmer's complete statement of purpose, and may be executed as a Deed, by Affirmer in any jurisdiction where a Deed is adequate to accomplish the Waiver.

